# Phase 5 — Pipeline Rewiring: Detailed Migration Plan

## Overview

Phase 5 replaces the live extraction call in `analyzeRepository.ts`, swapping `extractImports()` with `extractAll()` + `toLegacyResult()`. This is the highest-risk phase — it touches the production code path for the first time.

> [!CAUTION]
> The approved implementation plan specifies deleting `extractImports.ts` and `resolveAliases.ts` in this phase. **This plan recommends deferring those deletions.** See [Section 11](#11-deviation-from-approved-plan-deferred-deletions) for the rationale.

