## 1. Files Modified

### 1.1 [MODIFY] [analyzeRepository.ts](file:///C:/Users/srich/OneDrive/Desktop/Cartograph/lib/analysis/analyzeRepository.ts)

**Why**: This is the production entry point. It currently calls `extractImports()` directly. It must be rewired to use the new parser architecture.

**Changes**:

| Line | Current | New |
|------|---------|-----|
| Import | `import { extractImports } from "./extractImports"` | `import { extractAll, toLegacyResult } from "./extractAll"` |
| Import | *(none)* | `import { ParserRegistry } from "./parsers/registry"` |
| Import | *(none)* | `import { TypeScriptParser } from "./parsers/typescript/parser"` |
| L57 | `const discoveredFiles = await discoverSourceFiles(projectRoot)` | Convert `ProjectFile[]` → `ParseFileInput[]` (see below) |
| L59 | `const { files, parseErrors } = await extractImports(...)` | Registry setup → `extractAll()` → `toLegacyResult()` |
| L89 | `buildRepositoryIR(projectRoot, files)` | `buildRepositoryIR(projectRoot, extractionResult.extractions)` — pass `RawExtraction[]` directly |
| *(new)* | *(none)* | `registry.disposeAll()` in the `finally` block |

**Detailed transformation of the extraction section** (lines ~56–60):

```diff
-    const discoveredFiles = await discoverSourceFiles(projectRoot);
-    await report("parsing", `Parsing ${discoveredFiles.length} source files`);
-    const { files, parseErrors } = await extractImports(projectRoot, discoveredFiles);
+    const legacyDiscovered = await discoverSourceFiles(projectRoot);
+    // Convert ProjectFile[] → ParseFileInput[] for the new pipeline
+    const discoveredFiles = legacyDiscovered.map((f) => ({
+      absolutePath: f.absolutePath,
+      relativePath: f.filePath,
+    }));
+    await report("parsing", `Parsing ${discoveredFiles.length} source files`);
+
+    // --- New parser architecture (Milestone 2) ---
+    const registry = new ParserRegistry();
+    registry.register(new TypeScriptParser());
+    await registry.initializeAll({ projectRoot, discoveredFiles });
+
+    let extractionResult;
+    try {
+      extractionResult = await extractAll(projectRoot, discoveredFiles, registry);
+    } finally {
+      registry.disposeAll();
+    }
+    const { files, parseErrors } = toLegacyResult(extractionResult);
```

**Why the conversion is needed**: `discoverSourceFiles()` returns `ProjectFile[]` (with `absolutePath` + `filePath`). The new pipeline expects `ParseFileInput[]` (with `absolutePath` + `relativePath`). The fields are semantically identical — only the property name differs. The conversion is a trivial map.

